{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And He said:</b> All is by way of prophetic visions, as He says to Jeremiah: \"What do you see?\" and he said, \"A rod of an almond (שקד)\" and He answered: \"For I am watching (שוקד)\" — watching, I will not move and I will not turn away until I carry out My words. And behold, just as the fruit comes only at its end (קץ), so the end (קץ) comes — \"I will not again pass over\" for this end. Yefet said: \"pass over its iniquity.\""], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:32.873314711Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}